given-names>Z</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Cercignani</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Audoin</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Ciccarelli</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Miller</surname><given-names>DH</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2007</year>) <article-title>Localized grey matter damage in early primary progressive multiple sclerosis contributes to disability</article-title>. <source>Neuroimage</source><volume>37</volume>: <fpage>253</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>261</lpage><comment>doi:<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.neuroimage.2007.04.056">10.1016/j.neuroimage.2007.04.056</ext-link></comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17566765</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0063250-Pirko1"><label>9</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Pirko</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Lucchinetti</surname><given-names>CF</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Sriram</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Bakshi</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name> (<year>2007</year>) <article-title>Gray matter involvement in multiple sclerosis</article-title>. <source>Neurology</source><volume>68</volume>: <fpage>634</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>642</lpage><comment>doi:<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1212/01.wnl.0000250267.85698.7a">10.1212/01.wnl.0000250267.85698.7a</ext-link></comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17325269</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0063250-Smith1"><label>10</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Jenkinson</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Johansen-Berg</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Rueckert</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Nichols</surna